S-Stop it!

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:27.330
Why do you have this smell?!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:28.980
Who are you?!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:39.700
The cafeteria food here 
is quite highly rated.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.480
It looks good!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:43.120
There's such a variety!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.480
This is incredible.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:51.700
Master, they all taste amazing!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.400
Don't talk while eating.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.230
You never change at all.

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.340
Glutton.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.770
I wouldn't have the energy 
I need if I didn't eat.

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:02.000
That's bad manners. And we can't
understand what you're saying.

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:02.860
Is it good?

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:05.360
It's not all for you, Lulune.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.690
You can't monopolize it.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:07.890
Lulune-san!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:12.770
Please behave properly as 
a student of this academy!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:13.620
Bad!

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:18.950
You're... Seiichi-kun?

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:26.420
Are you...

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:28.810
You're...

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:29.960
That woman!

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:29.960
I'm still talking!

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.500
Kannazuki-senpai?

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.800
Seiichi-kun!

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:46.290
I finally found you!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.920
<b>Uwaaaaaaaah</b>

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.650
Seiichi and Kannazuki are finally reunited.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.210
Though his wife, girlfriend, servant,

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:05.580
and little sister happened 
to be there at the same time!

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:07.790
I sense pandemonium!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.920
What fate awaits Seiichi?

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:20.330
Look. Over there.

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:23.950
So that's Barbador Magic Academy?

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:37.280
They even have the nerve 
to put a barrier around it?

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.070
How futile.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:44.630
My, it's sturdy.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:46.010
Hey! You there!

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:47.490
What are you doing?!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.670
Could you please open this gate for us?

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.500
We have important business to attend to.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.180
Answer the question!

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:56.420
You can't just pass that off as a joke!

00:19:56.820 --> 00:20:00.840
Please open the gate and let us in.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.880
Hey! What's wrong with you?!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.690
You, too, please.

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:14.720
Your power sure helps in moments like these.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.330
Makes it easy.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.820
Now, let's get going.

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:27.120
Yeah.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.730
I sure wish I had some 
teleportation magic already.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.120
Indeed.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:12.290
Ding-dong, dang-dong.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:15.250
Introduce yourselves to 
everyone watching at home!

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:15.940
Right.

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:16.690
Yo!

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:17.090
Sure.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:21.270
I can't believe Agnos-kun 
is raising his hand!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.850
Okay, then, Agnos.

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:24.510
Hey! I'm Agnos!

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:27.670
My favorite word is "spirit"! Nice to meet you!

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:28.980
I'm glad you're so full of energy!

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:30.370
Next is Baird!

00:22:30.720 --> 00:23:02.710
<b>Baird Lutra
Nice to meet you!</b>

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:33.050
Short and simple!

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:34.370
Okay, Helen!

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.830
Helen-san? Helen-san?

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.730
Sheesh! I'm Helen Rosa!

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:40.290
My favorite thing is flowers.

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.110
I loathe Theobald!

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:43.970
Nice to meet you.

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:45.790
Last is Brud!

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:47.460
Yes, I'm Brud.

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:48.840
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:49.490
So normal!

00:22:49.490 --> 00:22:50.030
Huh?

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:51.670
Now, Seiichi-sensei,

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:53.550
let's get class started!

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:55.100
Yes! Okay, everyone!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:57.740
Do you know what effect this herb has?

00:22:57.740 --> 00:22:59.160
Me, me, me, me!

00:22:59.160 --> 00:22:59.940
Agnos!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:01.230
It restores youth!

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:02.210
Guilty!

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:02.960
Gufire!

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:11.770
<b>Fire?</b>

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:06.790
No way! Even an accidental "Fire" 
from his scream is enough?!

00:23:06.790 --> 00:23:09.070
Oh, no, this is bad!

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:11.770
This is Charm Weed.

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:16.360
Breathing in its smoke makes you fall 
in love with whoever's holding it.

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:21.040
Boss Man! I love you!

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.250
I will be yours.

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:24.210
I love you!

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:27.950
Oh, how could I?! We're both teachers!

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:29.230
Guilty...

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:33.750
Boss Man, I love you!

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.970
<b><b>Class Dismissed</b></b>

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.660
Class dismissed!

00:23:35.870 --> 00:23:37.770
It's been so long, Kannazuki-senpai.

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:40.790
Huh?! Why are your 
nostrils flaring so hard?!

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:42.430
The guy I was before 
evolving will show up, too?

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:44.060
Why?! What's going on?!

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:46.350
Next time, "Reunited With Kannazuki Karen"!

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
<b>Next Time
Reunited With Kannazuki Karen</b>

00:23:46.350 --> 00:23:49.160
Nanjourno!
